    ('description:"Compose V2 integrates with the Docker CLI and can be run as \'docker\n          compose\'. Checking this setting aliases \'/usr/local/bin/docker-compose\'\n          to \'docker compose\' for improved compatibility with other applications\n          and scripts."', 'description:"Compose V2 已整合至 Docker CLI，可用 \'docker compose\' 執行。勾選此設定會將 \'/usr/local/bin/docker-compose\' 別名為 \'docker compose\'，以提升與其他應用程式和指令碼的相容性。"'),
    ("description:`Compose V2 integrates with the Docker CLI and can be run as 'docker\n          compose'. Checking this setting aliases '/usr/local/bin/docker-compose'\n          to 'docker compose' for improved compatibility with other applications\n          and scripts.`", "description:`Compose V2 已整合至 Docker CLI，可用 'docker compose' 執行。勾選此設定會將 '/usr/local/bin/docker-compose' 別名為 'docker compose'，以提升與其他應用程式和指令碼的相容性。`"),
