    ('description:"Docker VMM is a more efficient virtual machine manager for Apple Silicon. Apple\nVirtualization framework is a mature alternative; HyperKit is only available on Intel Macs."', 'description:"Docker VMM 是適用於 Apple Silicon 的更有效率虛擬機器管理員。Apple Virtualization framework 是較成熟的替代方案；HyperKit 僅適用於 Intel Mac。"'),
