    ('description:"Docker VMM offers the fastest performance across common developer tasks. WSL2 is the most stable and suitable for most use-cases. Hyper-V may be better for managed or restricted environments."', 'description:"Docker VMM 在常見開發工作上效能最快。WSL 2 最穩定，適合多數使用情境。受管或受限環境可能較適合 Hyper-V。"'),
