    ('description:"Docker is set to detect whether your host supports IPv4 and/or IPv6. It automatically filters unsupported DNS\nrecord types (A or AAAA) to prevent containers from attempting failed connections."', 'description:"Docker 會偵測主機是否支援 IPv4 與／或 IPv6，並自動過濾不支援的 DNS 紀錄型別（A 或 AAAA），避免 containers 嘗試失敗的連線。"'),
