    ('Fragment,null,`Exposing daemon on TCP without TLS helps legacy clients connect to the daemon. It\nalso makes your system vulnerable to remote code execution attacks. Use with caution.`', 'Fragment,null,`在沒有 TLS 的情況下以 TCP 公開 daemon，可方便舊版使用者端連線，但也會讓系統暴露於遠端程式碼執行攻擊風險。請謹慎使用。`'),
    ('description:"Host networking allows containers that are started with --net=host use localhost to connect to TCP and\nUDP services on the host. It automatically allows software on the host to use localhost to connect to\nTCP and UDP services in the container."', 'description:"Host networking 可讓以 --net=host 啟動的 containers 透過 localhost 連線到主機上的 TCP 與 UDP 服務，並自動允許主機上的軟體以 localhost 連線到 container 內的 TCP 與 UDP 服務。"'),
