    ('description:"Select which IP family Docker Desktop should skip for DNS\n          resolution. Useful if your containers have connectivity issues due\n          to your LAN missing IPv4 or IPv6 support. In <b>Auto</b> mode,\n          Docker Desktop automatically detects missing IP support and inhibits\n          DNS resolution for that family."', 'description:"選擇 Docker Desktop 在 DNS 解析時要略過的 IP 族群。若因區域網路缺少 IPv4 或 IPv6 支援而導致 containers 連線問題，此設定很有用。在 <b>Auto</b> 模式下，Docker Desktop 會自動偵測缺少的 IP 支援並抑制該族群的 DNS 解析。"'),
    ('description:`Select which IP family Docker Desktop should skip for DNS\n          resolution. Useful if your containers have connectivity issues due\n          to your LAN missing IPv4 or IPv6 support. In <b>Auto</b> mode,\n          Docker Desktop automatically detects missing IP support and inhibits\n          DNS resolution for that family.`', 'description:`選擇 Docker Desktop 在 DNS 解析時要略過的 IP 族群。若因區域網路缺少 IPv4 或 IPv6 支援而導致 containers 連線問題，此設定很有用。在 <b>Auto</b> 模式下，Docker Desktop 會自動偵測缺少的 IP 支援並抑制該族群的 DNS 解析。`'),
    ('Fragment,null,`Select which IP family Docker Desktop should skip for DNS\n          resolution. Useful if your containers have connectivity issues due\n          to your LAN missing IPv4 or IPv6 support. In <b>Auto</b> mode,\n          Docker Desktop automatically detects missing IP support and inhibits\n          DNS resolution for that family.`', 'Fragment,null,`選擇 Docker Desktop 在 DNS 解析時要略過的 IP 族群。若因區域網路缺少 IPv4 或 IPv6 支援而導致 containers 連線問題，此設定很有用。在 <b>Auto</b> 模式下，Docker Desktop 會自動偵測缺少的 IP 支援並抑制該族群的 DNS 解析。`'),
